{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1789791058519,"sessionID":"ses_f4824f550ffeaBmxcEcK2h5aW9","part":{"id":"prt_0b7dc3a55001oApK7Qew5df4z9","messageID":"msg_0b7dc31d1001zeQq21wQY5pu4V","sessionID":"ses_f4824f550ffeaBmxcEcK2h5aW9","snapshot":"36671a73fdd87b7187a8587d64cc7db02d083554","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1789791061559,"sessionID":"ses_f4824f550ffeaBmxcEcK2h5aW9","part":{"id":"prt_0b7dc42960014oVvbxuIgsD3vJ","messageID":"msg_0b7dc31d1001zeQq21wQY5pu4V","sessionID":"ses_f4824f550ffeaBmxcEcK2h5aW9","type":"text","text":"The regression is in three Lua checks: they accept any existing lock instead of comparing its token with the caller’s. Immediate retry also promotes delayed jobs before checking ownership; I’m moving that step after validation so a rejected retry cannot emit promotion events. The administrative `\"0\"` token behavior remains intact.\n","time":{"start":1789791060630,"end":1789791061556},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0107345ab8d00539016aae0b549d8087d18d660b24b700e753","phase":"commentary"}}}}
